  "synchronization": "useFrameCallback在UI线程累加实际delta并限制64ms；uniforms由derived value传给一个Rect的SkRuntimeEffect。shader把周期映射到斜向光带，presence在周期两端衰减掩盖重启；底色亮度调节深浅主题效果。编译结果缓存于模块级cachedEffect。",
  "interruption": "active=false时setActive(false)并time=0；重新开始从起点。AppState和reduceMotionChanged订阅在卸载移除，frame cleanup关闭。",
